                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Since these probe statements all have \"BUS\" identifiers, shouldn't we also include a probe statement for the device they are connected to (the CMM?)?  As is, these JSON files aren't really stand-alone FRU identifiers like EM configs are intended to be."
                },
                {
