                        "username": "Quanta-YangChen"
                    },
                    "message": "I want to confirm with you: Do you mean we should add one probe condition to \"FOUND\" the CMM that those network blades connected to?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/minerva_janga_smb.json",
